<title>Singapore: Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 27.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - June 27.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   94/96     99/100    UNQ    163/166</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  98/100   101/104  173/175  183/185</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Prompt enquiries supported Singapore bunker levels on Friday, traders said. A supplier said he fixed a 380-cst parcel at around $99 per tonne, the same trading level on Thursday. Traders said bunker prices would depend largely on cargo market movements in the near term.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
</text>
